  <Section label="Teaching" title="Courses taught">
    <div class="grid"><div class="span-8">
      <p>Nine courses at Waterloo between 2021 and 2024, across Global Business and Digital Arts and Management Sciences: Introduction to UX, Advanced UX Design and Research, the UX research seminar, the undergraduate capstone, Human-Computer Interaction, and Analytics and User Experience. Around 700 students from nine departments.</p>
    </div></div>
